_direct_delete`：fresh process 載入後，拒絕原因含 `I42: delete the owning assembly instance`，dump 不變，拒絕前後整份 `assembly-read` 相等。\n- `test_formal_rule_line_timber_undo_redo_survives_reset_load`：undo、redo 後先 `reset` 並證明指定集合已空，再 `loadfile`。共用 `roundtrip()` 沒有改。\n\nbridge 來源指紋 `0c1e19603546dab1c18a887debbc25298eb4c57b0e694525fb1777c14658baed`，exe SHA-256 `507ae331edea9f530b3b22af5f8d46eee8d6d26a95f947f742ed96144ebada1b`。沒有重編。`Ran 2 tests in 1.087s`，`OK`，結束碼 0。無 sidecar 的另一次是 `skipped=2`，不算。\n\n狀態：程式測試已補上這兩支、完整驗收待辦、CI run `37804408304` 是 7 jobs、0 steps（CI 未執行，沒有重跑）、尚未合併、保持 draft。歷史 10／155 與 PR #161 缺件仍缺。\n","created_at":"2026-10-08T14:51:12Z","updated_at":"2026-10-08T15:58:09Z","closed_at":null,"merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"3402f45b7f99de5667f2778e6f5cf05ba4afd126","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":true,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/pulls/171/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/pulls/171/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/issues/171/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/statuses/fd5b8c8c2ca65111bdc1cc33a2b9e6bb0a1ff44d","head":{"label":"ZhiQiYang:docs/save-reopen-contract-20261008","ref":"docs/save-reopen-contract-20261008","sha":"fd5b8c8c2ca65111bdc1cc33a2b9e6bb0a1ff44d","user":{"login":"ZhiQiYang","id":59477728,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU5NDc3NzI4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/59477728?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang","html_url":"https://github.com/ZhiQiYang","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url